      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "© 2013 The Authors. Influenza and Other Respiratory Viruses Published by John Wiley & Sons Ltd.",
        "AbstractText": "We report an adolescent with respiratory symptoms admitted for clinical signs of an acute abdomen. The only diagnostic finding was influenza A viral RNA detected in an upper respiratory tract specimen. Influenza should be considered in the differential diagnosis of children with respiratory illness and abdominal pain during influenza season."
      },
